tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339490/extras/b2ba989efda788defda4b751e6315775.webm?t=1739748395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339490/extras/b2ba989efda788defda4b751e6315775.mp4?t=1739748395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's also a lot of work to be done inside. Remove everything that is damaged and unnecessary and install the necessary equipment in a practical way. Comfort is the most important, so research the necessary amenities carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339490/extras/7e7ee36865aa030045f5a67be89aae64.poster.avif?t=1739748395\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339490/extras/7e7ee36865aa030045f5a67be89aae64.webm?t=1739748395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339490/extras/7e7ee36865aa030045f5a67be89aae64.mp4?t=1739748395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the camper is ready, select the destination out of many possible options, inspired by the real locations along the legendary Route 66. Meet new, sometimes crazy friends. Deal with surprising, unusual situations. Beware of changing weather conditions and, above all, the shenanigans of your troublemaker son and his new colleagues. Present your motorhome to other tourists, so that, at the end of the summer, you can earn money for selling your camper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339490/extras/ddc2caa4e2808c9b77a13523735f326b.poster.avif?t=1739748395\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339490/extras/ddc2caa4e2808c9b77a13523735f326b.webm?t=1739748395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339490/extras/ddc2caa4e2808c9b77a13523735f326b.mp4?t=1739748395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the money you have earned to bid on a range of new caravan wrecks. Invest in repairs, renovations and adequate equipment to prepare the vehicle as expected by future buyers, specific to the selected region of the US. If you do not over-invest, you should have a lot of cash left, which you can allocate for the development of your office, workshop and for subsequent campers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339490/extras/9aa5de377725e495472fac593417f2a7.poster.avif?t=1739748395\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339490/extras/9aa5de377725e495472fac593417f2a7.webm?t=1739748395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339490/extras/9aa5de377725e495472fac593417f2a7.mp4?t=1739748395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each camper has a history behind it and offers new challenges, but also adventures on subsequent campsites. Don't be surprised by what you'll find in the renovated campers. The junk lef inside might not only prove useful, but might also allow you to learn the habits of the previous owner. Additionally, it may turn out to be an unexpected problem to solve or the beginning of something new - and possibly good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339490/extras/99f82181f45ac118055077cd124569f1.poster.avif?t=1739748395\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339490/extras/99f82181f45ac118055077cd124569f1.webm?t=1739748395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1339490/extras/99f82181f45ac118055077cd124569f1.mp4?t=1739748395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One is never lonely living in a camper. During your camping trips you will meet many new and well-known people. Sometimes you might get the impression that some of them are stalking you, because they always pop up wherever you go with a new camper for sale. Some may simply be mean. Others may surprise you. Camper camping adventures maybe a greater challenge than renovations of old campings.</p>",
